# source induces (a function-add reseed per the "leaf = byte-identical only for const-only" finding). Verified:
# `static inline long tk_syscall1(` appears as real emitted C in the sys_exit_group fixture's output but only as
# a quoted string literal (the emitter's own source data) in the compiler's own teko.c — genuinely use-gated.
#
# NATIVE LEG — HONEST-STOP (by design). A `syscallN` call falls into the terminal `_ =>` of `lower_call`
